{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=814 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/dde6b5ea2084c9c7d198ed974b81f10c.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no turning back! [ONE &amp; DONE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Consumption &amp; Switching</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a weapon\u2019s gauge is fully depleted, it automatically switches to the next one.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable weapon changes can turn the tide in your favor \u2014 or against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/a41051b3ac7f3ba7f8ef3801b39e334f.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 7-Floor Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more complex and powerful the bosses become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must learn enemy patterns and adapt. Of course, that takes time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=500 height=950 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/e330205605a0483e745bbffb3e0c73a3.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to give up?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were <i>this close</i>. One more hit\u2026 just one more strike, and it would\u2019ve been over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze is always waiting for your next challenge.\ud83d\ude0e</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.poster.avif?t=1769075817\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.webm?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/extras/972410ae1cea170073a697d8e8a24bdc.mp4?t=1769075817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424220?t=1769075817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424220/7f2ce0f27a2cef0c4784e6b62f5435506bd